#: scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18555b2ac4a821781ca5939807afd14e6ab350bcd6389bdd9cf3b6c64650be70
#. default-sha256: 974c0d17a06a304599d6cc2ddd663e160a979a85a442fea94a1d2fc5210fab08
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫...And so, my life came to an end."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫………이게 ⟪k:23⟫나의 끝이다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 746c57703e47cc682422f0e56ad1350ed809f7173d0d02e9bdfe0363ab6c6e48
#. default-sha256: 40d525397097da9f344666676255cd9f87e0e807b3344f0f41242a454e3f1ed8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the end of the story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫아직…… 전부 끝난 건 아니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e2c181a2cd6b1d4843d372be49d9e4f4d261c771a3268722ed165aad7cd9a4b
#. default-sha256: de6b6b5d28721f2c5b183c806d10833bdc4fd12a3a47af5584e18fe83c22c067
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know if what comes next could be called “my” story,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but memories of these "
"events linger in my soul."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이를 ⟪k:1⟫나의 뒷이야기라 불러도 될진 모르겠으나……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나에게는 혼의 기억이 남아 있다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: face0fa892738e80771052f4d0af8bd92066342119dae87cbdf01cf100eae071
#. default-sha256: 9334f4f6346c60ac3f0e8f4a6633d136c728687c49e82fc24c3ead50beecf134
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How could I have ever imagined...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that I would be made to witness my own misery "
"even in death?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫과연 그 누가…… ⟪k:1⟫목숨을 잃고도 ⟪k:2⟫절망적인 광경을 더 봐야 한단 걸 예상하겠는가……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fe07d06366af44d63d70588d93eec20ccd013afb68dc43b388e9f8b33983ea8
#. default-sha256: 67e6be4e43303cb6bbc8beef2593f736366ff13116e275d1a1509707e0c076de
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And my soul—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫evidently still bound to my flesh—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 혼은 ⟪k:1⟫아직도 육체와 연결되어 있는 건지――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 거절조차 무시하고, ⟪k:4⟫강제적으"
"로……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cf32deb0f31a0891a1f38b66d2e693a3594cdff2e6346fe50d6a58d9db6ed02
#. default-sha256: addd0e3ca63c9f5ef4a2bf4aa83cac44f83f57672acc4db3d14ee3450a45e7a3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was dragged along with it, against my will, down to the nearby village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 시체와 함께 ⟪k:1⟫마을로 이동되었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1c9cdd46054ce8904781ed479085c4e55d607f04785898877be8f01014a35e9
#. default-sha256: 590359d195db331a6b7be7717e9219f8fb2561faf6ceaec9177dec95dae37b67
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The knights have returned from their holy quest!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기사님들께서 귀환하셨어!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96d459e3425f279d40c1b027ed44aedced69554a640ff9f3cec6a7df21f0bc6b
#. default-sha256: 113fddfeee122ece629e4067058ccf507d01325045f740ef1f811d5bca0c4929
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, how we’ve awaited your arrival!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아아, 기사님!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ac5700930ccbe09a50ff006a0a1e84cf81efdbd559da8e1a4436b31770d68a1
#. default-sha256: e5a86f70a305e1a9706f313e59c8e500ff1a143d098283e75fe2187b09d7459b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How glorious it is to see you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기다렸습니다!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0ca14a667a0a47823f01903f0dec56d72a458a5a2e8348af9f5c67d8d8f4840
#. default-sha256: 5c3029956aa5ed8cce39c6c482e1caff7a763f21387df97b32ea1792f340fa54
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Waiting for us there was a cluster of villagers.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A large cross lay on the ground in "
"the center of the square."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫우리를 맞이한 건 ⟪k:1⟫광장에 모인 마을 사람들이었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 중앙에는 거대한 십자가가 눕"
"혀져 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27611d98ec03e913ef0803cdeabb55f778d26cd3adcd42f49b5f0afac9030c5c
#. default-sha256: 218cb6e24976913edda833d9ae105c4d389b382f36f99ce0f1b03d4077d4d8f9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Holding torches, they formed a crowd around the knights, several of them familiar faces."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫횃불을 든 채 ⟪k:1⟫기사들을 둘러싼 민중 중에는 ⟪k:2⟫낯익은 얼굴이 몇몇 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75a343f239f4a8a137a175c4faaf9df7cee48b2b9ddd8f5288d063961064bca2
#. default-sha256: da3f303c2b5c74cc3aaed4274418e7d35bfda82ac5cb2a0f24ff73544295946a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer shall we live in fear of the curse befalling us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eternal peace is assured!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이제 ⟪k:1⟫마을에 저주가 걸릴 걱정은 없어! ⟪k:2⟫이 마을은 영원한 평온을 약속받은 거야!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a010b994e69e8118c2250aa69ee40c8638853c437c08cbadaa95cda9d767425
#. default-sha256: 119e2c21bae737baed7eec358df2bd6223179ae8015ab2ea114a869b5f1430b0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why, then... ⟪k:1⟫were they acting like I was at fault?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런데 ⟪k:1⟫왜…… 모든 게 내 탓이 되는 걸까."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9fcf94d0d16ec8ec159ee58cd80fa5b6c6407f62618b3507e64d4dc75f2ce21
#. default-sha256: 723f8dc73349f1572621f120f0ca2fa696717d231800be19f187332eb52363a9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I the sinner, and why did I need to be judged?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어째서 내게 죄가 있으며, ⟪k:1⟫내가 심판을 받아야 하는 걸까."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c3ce3259058edce42ee8a547a72f339bec25e185837bf101b644c80ead84162
#. default-sha256: 1916148836091982b6246e6cf5fc3ba19f892488f9bfe7a5a2000b99edf1f79a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My soul trembled at the overwhelming fervor consuming the crowd, ⟪k:1⟫their zealous desire "
"to see judgment cast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마녀를 심판하는 기이한 열광 속에서――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내 마음은 덜덜 떨렸다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 411aff4d87e8e7b9814b8e1d16e136d79d499401539029f81e48f605e71db9d4
#. default-sha256: 284b6a608c4957385fb6ba41e37ae2d4a5314ed4f8b73e55692ad2e41d1940be
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please don’t do this, Didier...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, hear my voice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫형님……, ⟪k:1⟫부탁드립니다, ⟪k:2⟫그만하십시오…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제 말을 들어 주십시오……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 014e0acc0c3813c056ab15c115c5c3ad9d58e7f55c8c1f01c0e65c8594ea2c5c
#. default-sha256: 036bd654f557a0b903cf6b0b674f86901c8ac042f838f0ed6a9384cb6a0919c8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, tell me ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫, at least, don’t think I did those things..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫형님, ⟪k:1⟫부디 ⟪k:2⟫알아 주십시오…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫당신만큼은 ⟪k:5⟫알아 주시길 바랍니다……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c16c9489300d64fc641238966ae513df0b42c9bfa1daccb1daae7ba0892edffd
#. default-sha256: 0a85715a3b90696b92719f4ede676ff1938efd59519bd2fbc36c23def121c5ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t put me on that cross...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If it was Mother who sold me out to the Church,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 시체를 십자가에 매달지 말아 주십시오…….⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫어머님께서 저를 마녀로 교회에 넘겼다면――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8dc520ed61c3cbcb8b7f453d78f6c9d94de7589257fbac1fab5c33af880f3f8
#. default-sha256: a2ae178a1a6b20447b2b1c1ae8b9ec17087a83fad16195e16c8a022cb5ec9929
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The nails and rope for the crucifixion are here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We would have you, O knight, "
"deliver the Lord’s judgment unto this vile witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫책형에 쓸 쇠못과 밧줄은 ⟪k:1⟫저희가 준비했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫기사님……, ⟪k:4⟫부디 당신의 손으로 "
"⟪k:5⟫마녀에게 최후의 심판을!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3521bf1a2f020d7836dcf0b2110e326a387f50ef59f60ca07d5049d3c4647a66
#. default-sha256: 1ae2ca05a48e20babf71ea3fa6797183fcb16fb98a7bc972bf2041187be99bf4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……형님……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 063da078fca2329acfdba7b03537cc3c11fc03fc720f68f8a4c515c703a8a9af
#. default-sha256: f6a58aee60feaa7487cfebf4c401521d8e3c637cc3095505fc751a6ba8b67178
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucifixion!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫십자가에!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 063da078fca2329acfdba7b03537cc3c11fc03fc720f68f8a4c515c703a8a9af
#. default-sha256: f6a58aee60feaa7487cfebf4c401521d8e3c637cc3095505fc751a6ba8b67178
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫십자가에!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0d9c5055793b8cbc8a45d80da38d48bb548887a37c1a914322661c83f628fe8
#. default-sha256: fb3cea4f0e6aadef6ca9123c9de26f93ec2311b99e14163ccee8d309ea246ad4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My brother lowered my corpse to the ground and began removing my clothing, ⟪k:1⟫and in that "
"very moment, I realized the purpose of hanging someone from a cross."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……형은 내 시체를 바닥에 눕히고, ⟪k:1⟫내 옷에 손을 댔다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫십자가에 매단다는 의미를 "
"⟪k:4⟫그 순간 똑똑히 이해하여――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48560e1b5d8e06f26e247a397c556be6f8e26577e987e26b0ef8af2b3ed06bf8
#. default-sha256: adfdc643fbfe7fb45b52e91a7dc513399490942f6d7a58dfd8963706b9e1b11d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Overwhelmed by hopelessness, tears streamed down my face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫크나큰 절망에 ⟪k:1⟫내 눈물이 ⟪k:2⟫멎을 줄을 몰랐다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F330EC48_B442_43BB_867C_F9A5674ECE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f58bf7b534c4b46fb6b17037f1a1f3e0ea9e117a133457dddaa8fccfc0838c9
